          “Built by people tired of buying clothes that end up at the back of the closet.”
        </blockquote>
        <cite>The NotMyColor team</cite>
      </div>

      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div>
        <h2>Quick answers.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
